1
00:00:00,539 --> 00:00:03,749
(Sheldon:)Granted not long,
but just deeply and well.

2
00:00:03,918 --> 00:00:04,958
(Leonard:)I'm not surprised.

3
00:00:05,127 --> 00:00:06,917
A well-known folk cure for insomnia...

4
00:00:07,088 --> 00:00:09,878
(Leonard:)...is to break
into your neighbor's apartment and clean.

5
00:00:10,758 --> 00:00:12,428
(Sheldon:)Sarcasm?

6
00:00:12,593 --> 00:00:13,763
(Leonard:)You think?

7
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:17,060
(Sheldon:)Granted, my methods
may have been somewhat unorthodox...

8
00:00:17,223 --> 00:00:20,013
...but the end result
will be a measurable enhancement...

9
00:00:20,184 --> 00:00:21,934
...to Penny's quality of life.

10
00:00:22,103 --> 00:00:25,603
You've convinced me, maybe we should
sneak in and shampoo her carpet.

11
00:00:25,773 --> 00:00:28,693
- You don't think that crosses a line?
- Yes.

12
00:00:28,859 --> 00:00:30,319
(Leonard:)For God's sake, Sheldon...

13
00:00:30,486 --> 00:00:34,276
(Leonard:)...do I have to hold up a sarcasm sign
every time I open my mouth?

14
00:00:34,448 --> 00:00:37,288
(Sheldon:)You have a sarcasm sign?

15
00:00:39,078 --> 00:00:41,618
(Leonard:)No, I do not have a sarcasm sign.

16
00:00:42,164 --> 00:00:43,204
You want some cereal?

17
00:00:43,374 --> 00:00:46,834
I feel so good today, I'm gonna choose
from the low-fiber end of the shelf.

18
00:00:47,002 --> 00:00:49,292
(Sheldon:)Hello, Honey Puffs.

19
00:00:49,463 --> 00:00:51,503
PENNY:
Son of a bitch!

20
00:00:52,466 --> 00:00:54,296
(Leonard:)Penny's up.

21
00:00:54,468 --> 00:00:57,508
PENNY:
You sick, geeky bastards!

22
00:00:58,472 --> 00:01:01,022
(Leonard:)How did she know it was us?

